      "interpretation": "Integrated rehearsal shows successful same-session retrieval and transfer alongside persistent article/noun-pair inconsistency. Geographic omission is coverage gap, not evidence of inability. No independent spoken-readiness, durable mastery or retention claim. Newly recalled bañera appears once with un and later correctly with la, important counterevidence to categorical unknown-gender diagnosis.",
